{"n":63,"level":"A1","title":"Irregular past 1","pt":"Passado irregular 1","scene":"market","tod":"day","cast":["Pablo","Rosa","Pog"],"fic":{"scene":"market","tod":"day","decor":[],"cast":[{"p":{"hs":"side","outfit":"shirt","top":"#f2b84b","hair":"brown","skin":"tan","arms":"wave"}},{"p":{"hs":"braids","outfit":"shirt","top":"#f08a4b","hair":"brown","skin":"tan","arms":"point"}},{"p":{"hs":"spiky","outfit":"shirt","top":"#7b5cf0","hair":"blue","skin":"light","arms":"out"}}]},"minutes":64,"slides":[{"t":"cover","min":1,"title":"Irregular past 1","pt":"Passado irregular 1","level":"A1","n":63,"cast":["Pablo","Rosa","Pog"]},{"t":"goals","min":1,"goal":"Usar os verbos irregulares mais comuns.","canDo":["Conhecer 12 irregulares","Usar went, saw, had, ate, bought, got","Contar um dia de compras"]},{"t":"warm","min":2,"q":"Que verbos você conhece no passado sem -ed?","pt":"Faça o jogo 'go → went'.","chips":["We went to the market.","I saw a big fish.","She bought some apples.","He had a coffee."]},{"t":"curious","min":1,"title":"Irregulares que você já usa","text":"Você usa irregulares o tempo todo: was, had, went, did, said, got, made, saw. Os 20 mais comuns representam mais de 60% de todos os verbos no passado.","kind":"Você sabia?"},{"t":"scene","min":1,"text":"Pablo e Rosa foram ao mercado e voltaram cheios de histórias.","line":"Where did you go yesterday, Pablo?","who":["Pablo","Rosa","Pog"]},{"t":"article","min":2,"title":"At the market yesterday","text":"Yesterday Pablo went to the market. He saw many things: red apples, big fish, colorful hats and old books. He bought apples and a fish. He ate a sandwich and drank coffee at a small stall. Then he met Mia. She gave him a book about cooking. \"I found it at a second-hand stall,\" she said. Pablo got home at six and cooked fish with rice using a recipe from the book. His family ate every bit. It was a wonderful day.","pt":"Pablo volta do mercado com compras e um livro de presente.","qs":[{"q":"O que Pablo bebeu?","op